#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:5
#: 210df7b4f0644e04bc967c0f853f1104 4b21d6ebb2454554a0c67ae761028d9b
#: b1ffa87ae8b44087872ec52696c6857b b8ecb0936b244231a87fa800e9572abe
#: f861548fe6564a778552fed02077009b
msgid "Camera Triggering using Seagull REC"
msgstr "使用 Seagull REC 触发相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:10
#: 2848ca26a3054a4b96e3e9e11c233b89 43617814932d458b90fa34014acc8048
#: 5d63e38879e94510b48caf2c09f42a7e a1f04c2925f34d8481e79c234570c8e2
#: eae3857bf7e244108faa03a2f5e055bb
msgid ""
"`Seagull REC <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-rec/>`__ provides "
"everything needed to connect a Pixhawk to a supported Sony MultiPort™ "
"equipped camera in order to automate camera shutter triggering. The current "
"list of compatible cameras `can be found here "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-rec/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Seagull REC <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-rec/>`__ 提供将 "
"Pixhawk 连接到支持 Sony MultiPort™ 的相机所需的一切，以实现相机快门触发自动化。当前兼容相机列表 `可在此处找到 "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-rec/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:12
#: 1ebb901884ea423cb086b4bd02165d56 378fa03405e1400a958f81b6f959d423
#: 3cd38a06b26e4ad28a4f7f6cd5009947 434a0d1959c046d7b868e160d7c7e310
#: 7be5d21aae50415e9e82c5105f9c4b4e
msgid "The board supports three shutter trigger modes:"
msgstr "该板支持三种快门触发模式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:14
#: 15e3ee4137094383ae5fb8560022e9c0 2ec0066298a7435d8012650b42ea4d08
#: 77bc94cbe1374ac0a98976fbe5f661c2 e222d1f5414e4cccbf93671816fdad74
#: f678b32523e441b7aff57a039afbf4ab
msgid ""
"**AF-T** (\"AutoFocus-Trigger\", with 1 second pre-focus followed by "
"trigger)"
msgstr "**AF-T** （「AutoFocus-Trigger」，预对焦 1 秒后触发）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:15
#: 028cad466e0c471a868a85b4790c6ed0 13e306e3d8cd4179afba75b0f565501c
#: 581493368f104dd1b594b8e650731f1b c1e83b1248d04c0a9a072ce0ec1742cc
#: c816ef098df140b2b458f8295e45440a
msgid ""
"**IS-T** (\"Instant-Trigger\", instant trigger as soon as camera locks "
"focus)"
msgstr "**IS-T** （「Instant-Trigger」，相机锁定焦点后立即触发）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:16
#: 25f09e325359434ab406d2db4a7c371d 2a4e7f8ee36743c89127d3a479e3435c
#: 6dc0c667598e48bea108e0355ac670a7 72e4fdeb0201464fa9bdb8e22754a6c7
#: caa56fffac8844968a3a85f034f4f9d4
msgid "**Manual** (\"Three stage trigger control\", neutral-focus-trigger)"
msgstr "**Manual** （「三段式触发控制」，neutral-focus-trigger）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:18
#: 0f53df6b8f2b4d30ae5e9ddd5d15f573 14e3b09faa1d475cae51af79c5dce093
#: 7a641e920bfe499ab65601af2756484c 8bb49cd07189432fa036af04ebfc8b05
#: cf15ae3cbda0469180d34e15abec78c3
msgid ""
"Seagull REC also supports **\"Video RECORD\", \"ZOOM\", \"Timelapse "
"Triggering\" and \"Camera ON/OFF\"**."
msgstr ""
"Seagull REC 还支持 **「Video RECORD」、「ZOOM」、「Timelapse Triggering」和「Camera "
"ON/OFF」**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:20
#: 072f54fa2c3544eea44d3b4fb0507205 4f88698ffe3b4edd99adfb28a0efa42e
#: 64dc39bab95f420b88635890511250d0 65af2d652f084bf5a7cc1327cffca30a
#: 7dd52587c7494cca9c61c03f77a8dca5
msgid ""
"More detailed instructions on how to setup REC are provided in the `Seagull "
"REC Manual <https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_REC-Manual.pdf>`__ as"
" well as `REC Support <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-rec-support/>`__ "
"page."
msgstr ""
"关于如何设置 REC 的详细说明，请参阅 `Seagull REC Manual "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_REC-Manual.pdf>`__ 以及 `REC "
"Support <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-rec-support/>`__ 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-rec.rst:22
#: 1c6644886d1d4e2fa6a045deb24419fc 1ea25453c5664fc3afc76e8e7d7871fe
#: 8a68b3e6d5c84c8b9942642afde35279 b9a00236c40b43509bca6056f30cf471
#: ec421998e7954ebda9d651a76487a536
